   '["Strap the vest tight and high so it does not bounce on the runs.", "Plan the 12 strict pull-ups as sets of 4 from the first round.", "On the dips, keep your elbows tucked and your shoulders down away from your ears.", "Kick up to the wall with a tight body and squeeze your glutes on the handstand push-ups.", "Treat failed reps as wasted energy; stop one rep short and rest briefly instead."]'::jsonb,
   'Go without the vest or use a lighter one. Use banded pull-ups, banded dips or bench dips, and pike push-ups or box pike push-ups for the handstand push-ups. Cut the runs to 800 m or do 3 rounds.',
