You complete 5 rounds of 3 rope climbs to 15 ft, 10 toes-to-bars, 21 overhead walking lunges with a plate (45 lb / 25 lb) and a 400 m run. That is 15 rope climbs and 50 toes-to-bars, which wear down your grip and trunk. The overhead lunges then demand steady shoulders, and the run comes before your arms recover.',
