   'time',
   'Yeti honors Mark Thomas Urban, 40, a Senior Smokejumper with the Bureau of Land Management''s Great Basin Smokejumpers. He was killed on Sept. 27, 2013, during a parachute jump while conducting an equipment evaluation at a remote airstrip outside Prairie, Idaho. He began his career as a wildland firefighter with the U.S. Forest Service in 1999.

You do 25 pull-ups and 10 muscle-ups, run 1.5 miles, then do 10 more muscle-ups and 25 more pull-ups. The 20 muscle-ups are the hardest part, and the second set comes on tired arms right after a long run. CrossFit does not say whether the muscle-ups are on rings or a bar, so note which you use.',
   '[{"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "25", "tip": "Chin clears the bar. Save your grip for the muscle-ups that follow."}, {"name": "Muscle-Ups", "reps": "10", "tip": "Ring or bar, CrossFit does not say. Get your chest over the rings or bar quickly."}, {"name": "Run", "reps": "1.5 miles", "tip": "Hold a steady pace and let your arms recover."}, {"name": "Muscle-Ups", "reps": "10", "tip": "Tired arms now. Take quick singles if sets fall apart."}, {"name": "Pull-Ups", "reps": "25", "tip": "The last set. Small sets with short rests."}]'::jsonb,
